Data from third-party sites
---------------------------

Some files in this repository hold data copied or derived from public web
pages and services of Sungkyunkwan University (SKKU) and of public bodies,
for example:

  - shuttle timetables, campus building and place names, and campus map
    shapes (such as scripts/data/ and src/building/place/);
  - the lists of department notice boards and their categories
    (src/notices/sources.json, src/notices/categories.json);
  - public transit timetables and station data from Seoul's open data
    services (such as scripts/subway-timetable/);
  - festival places and hours, including public content of the student
    council (scripts/data/).

That data belongs to its sources and stays under their terms. Its presence
here grants no license to it, and the Apache License does not apply to it.

Third-party content in test fixtures
------------------------------------

Test fixtures (files under __tests__/ and contracts/produced/fixtures/) hold
trimmed copies of third-party content, captured so that the tests run
offline. By source:

  - Sungkyunkwan University (SKKU):
      - notices: contracts/produced/fixtures/notices-*,
        __tests__/nest/notices/fixtures/, and the place names taken from
        notices in __tests__/nest/building/fixtures/place-labels.json;
      - campus map buildings, spaces and facilities:
        __tests__/nest/building/fixtures/skkumap-*.json;
      - the academic calendar:
        __tests__/nest/calendar/fixtures/academic-calendars.json;
      - cafeteria menus:
        __tests__/nest/meals/fixtures/crawler-meal-docs-2026-10-14.json;
  - Seoul's TOPIS bus API: __tests__/nest/bus/fixtures/topis-*.json,
    jongro-registry-routes.json, jongro-route-paths.json and
    jongro02-origin-idling-sightings.json in the same folder, and
    contracts/produced/fixtures/bus-realtime-group.realtimeGroup/jongro02.json;
  - Gyeonggi-do's GBIS bus API:
    __tests__/nest/bus/fixtures/gbis-location-7800.json;
  - the Seoul subway API and Seoul open data:
    __tests__/nest/subway/fixtures/realtime-*.json, seoul-station-info.json
    and subway-timetables/ in the same folder;
  - Seoul Metro's train map pages, cut to what the tests read:
    __tests__/nest/subway/fixtures/trainmap-*.html;
  - NAVER Directions: __tests__/nest/bus/fixtures/naver-directions-inja.json;
  - this server's own production responses, which carry the data above:
    the *.capture.json files under __tests__/ and the files under
    contracts/produced/fixtures/.

__tests__/nest/bus/fixtures/tmap-prediction-inja.json is synthetic and holds
no TMAP data: TMAP's terms forbid keeping it longer than 24 hours.

That content is not covered by the Apache License. It belongs to its
authors and is included only to test this software.
